# No credentials are needed to build this site. The API reference is generated
# from the spec committed in `spec/`. See README "API reference spec".

# Optional — point the build at a different spec, for example to preview an
# unpublished OpenAPI or Stainless config change. Both must be set together.
# OPENAPI_PATH=./spec/openapi.json
# STAINLESS_CONFIG_PATH=./spec/openapi.stainless.yml
